{"3153250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Great Report Era", "steam_appid": 3153250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "The Great Report Era is a 3D RPG political-simulating game, which displays the reflection of 5 different characters after the government of “Baussia” enacted the “Superpatriot Act” – a nationalist anti-espionage bill. The main gameplay (mechanism) is to collect the possible articles from dialogues, and to use your articles (from your own Superpatirot Act) to report other NPCs to the authority; meanwhile, the player will dig out the truth of “Great Drill Plan” through this process.", "about_the_game": "The Great Report Era is a 3D RPG political-simulating game, which displays the reflection of 5 different characters after the government of “Baussia” enacted the “Superpatriot Act” – a nationalist anti-espionage bill. The main gameplay (mechanism) is to collect the possible articles from dialogues, and to use your articles (from your own Superpatirot Act) to report other NPCs to the authority; meanwhile, the player will dig out the truth of “Great Drill Plan” through this process.", "short_description": "The Great Report Era is a 3D RPG political-simulating game, and can be easily played via mouse and keyboard. It simulates a situation that civilians spontaneously report each other to the authority due to an enacted &quot;Superpatriot Act&quot;. As the player, you need to decide the future of this nation.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153250/header.jpg?t=1765202938", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765202938", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3153250/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765202938", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit process